SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                100000 
NumberOfInitializationCycles 50000
PrintEvery                    1000
PrintPropertiesEvery          1000
Movies                        no
WriteMoviesEvery              1000
RestartFile no

Forcefield                    local
UseChargesFromCIFFile         yes
CutOffVDW                     12.9

Framework 0
FrameworkName IRMOF-1
UnitCells 1 1 1
ExternalTemperature 300.0
ExternalPressure   9236708.571873866

ComputeRDF yes
WriteRDFEvery 1000
ComputeEndToEndDistanceHistogram yes
ComputeDensityProfile3DVTKGrid yes
WriteDensityProfile3DVTKGridEvery 500
DensityProfile3DVTKGridPoints 10 10 10

